<title>USA: Mallinckrodt expands pharmaceutical plant.</title>
<headline>Mallinckrodt expands pharmaceutical plant.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mallinckrodt Inc said Monday it expanded manufacturing operations here with a U.S. Food and Drug Administration-registered facility for manufacturing pharmaceutical intermediates and additives.</p>
<p>Mallinckrodt said the $3.0 million expansion allows it to serve the pharmaceutical industry's need for higher levels of purity in intermediate chemicals.</p>
<p>The new facility manufactures a number of inorganic fine chemicals for use in the pharmaceutical industry. The facility can accommodate future expansion.</p>
<p>Mallinckrodt serves healthcare and specialty chemicals markets worldwide.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
